<title>FRANCE: French bonds &quot;poll-vaulted&quot; to highs at finish.</title>
<headline>French bonds &quot;poll-vaulted&quot; to highs at finish.</headline>
<text>
<p>1508 GMT - PIBOR surges to end at day highs along with bond futures, driven by weekend opinion polls turned in favour of centre-right election victory, foreign buying, short covering late in MATIF day, traders say. 10-year cash ylds fall.</p>
<p>*Jun 10-yr future 130.30, up 0.56. Vol 96,949. Open 129.78</p>
<p>*5.50 2007 OAT yield 5.59 pct vs 5.67. Bund spd -11 bp vs -9</p>
<p>*Call money unch at 3-1/8 1/4 pct. Jun PIBOR 96.50, up 16 bp</p>
</text>
